WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.533
Supervisor (British female): Good morning, Northwood Wildlife Park.

00:00:02.873 --> 00:00:05.784
Applicant (British male): Hello. I'm calling about the volunteer programme.

00:00:06.084 --> 00:00:07.503
Supervisor (British female): May I have your surname?

00:00:07.723 --> 00:00:12.073
Applicant (British male): Morgan. M, O, R, G, A, N.

00:00:12.323 --> 00:00:13.463
Supervisor (British female): When can you start?

00:00:13.683 --> 00:00:18.951
Applicant (British male): The twenty-second of March. I had planned the twentieth, but I have an exam that day.

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:20.786
Supervisor (British female): Which area would you prefer?

00:00:21.006 --> 00:00:23.572
Applicant (British male): The visitor centre, rather than the cafe.

00:00:23.872 --> 00:00:25.616
Supervisor (British female): Do you have any relevant training?

00:00:25.836 --> 00:00:28.114
Applicant (British male): Yes, a first-aid certificate.

00:00:28.414 --> 00:00:38.076
Supervisor (British female): Volunteers receive free lunch and a bus pass for each working day. A uniform is provided after the trial month. Accommodation and bicycle hire aren't available.

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:40.556
Applicant (British male): How should I send my photograph?

00:00:40.776 --> 00:00:46.561
Supervisor (British female): Upload it through the online form. Please ask your two referees to email their references directly.

00:00:46.861 --> 00:00:48.768
Applicant (British male): What is the earliest morning shift?

00:00:48.988 --> 00:00:54.784
Supervisor (British female): It begins at seven thirty. Staff meet at seven, but volunteers arrive half an hour later.

00:00:55.084 --> 00:01:01.844
Applicant (British male): Great. I'm especially interested in the bird survey because I want practical field experience before university.

00:01:02.144 --> 00:01:03.819
Supervisor (British female): I'll send the details today.
